SCRFD model notice
==================

The optional scrfd_2.5g_bnkps.onnx and scrfd_10g_bnkps.onnx weights originate
from the InsightFace SCRFD model family. The 10G file is det_10g.onnx from the
official InsightFace v0.7 buffalo_l model pack. InsightFace states that its
pretrained models are available for non-commercial research purposes only. The
plugin code does not grant any additional rights to those weights.

Review the current upstream terms before redistributing or using the model:
https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface#license

The local development copy is pinned by SHA-256 in MODEL-MANIFEST.txt.
